00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:00.870
Uh you can then take the designs and use

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:03.670
them in in application-specific

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:05.230
designs for digital circuits for

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:07.590
obviously consumer goods, automotive,

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:10.550
aerospace, and telecom products.

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:13.630
Um and I'll help you understand embedded

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:15.350
system on chips where you might use this

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:17.990
approach, Internet of Thing devices, and

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.630
high-performance network hardware where

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:22.590
they might well use um FPGAs as well.

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:24.230
And also custom hardware for data

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:26.550
centers, high-performance computing, and

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:28.030
edge computing.

