learning.

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:36.990
Although these are fairly simple devices

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:38.830
compared to some that you can get, all

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:40.670
the basic principles can be covered

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:42.070
using these.

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:44.550
So, there are career opportunities um if

